{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_bpipe_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_bpipe_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"難行長路","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_bpipe_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"173e8aa34bc3323ff8dbac5131dcff76229995905725c189b2700554dc6692ac","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"離開維多利亞的風笛，歷經磨難，意識到自己必須試著找一下幫手。她第一時間想到了身在龍門的陳。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"风笛"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_station"},{"type":"narration","text":"11:41 P.M. 天氣/陰\n龍門7區外 入城關口"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊督察，你總算來啦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我可是脫鞋脫了一半，就給你小子一通電訊叫出來，大晚上跑過大半個龍門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"——所以，你說的人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，抓、抓住了！現在正關在臨時監室裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"抓了？幾個人抓的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，就我和另一個執勤的兄弟......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......你說的，那是個維多利亞士兵，手裡還拿著挺嚇人的兵器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"我也搞不懂......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"我跟阿平還沒走近，她就丟掉了武器，舉著雙手揮了老半天，嘴裡還大聲喊著“我在這裡”，簡直跟生怕我們看不見一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"督察，我在這關口當了幾年差，真沒見過這種偷渡客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，我去會會她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，對了，你在電訊裡說，她還喊了什麼話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"她大炎官話講得很差......但聽起來似乎是，陳......陳？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"搞不好是我聽錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，我有數。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cellroomA"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哇，好亮——咦，終於有人來了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，來問幾個問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......審訊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"算是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，以前都是我審別人，突然換到被審問的位置上，還真不太習慣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"那你還乖乖交了武器......沒想過逃出去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從這裡出去應該還蠻簡單的......就算不用破城矛也......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，不，我不是這個意思！我忘了你是在審我......呃，我沒想過要跑啊，我是自願在這待著的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？很少見人喜歡蹲大獄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒也不是想被關著啦。只是，我聽說硬闖關口的話，會有警察來抓我......在龍門是叫近衛局對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就想找你們，所以用了個最快的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"找誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陳陳......我是說，陳。她是在近衛局吧？好像已經是......警司？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，好可惜，我本來還以為她得到消息會自己過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你和你說的這位陳警司有什麼關係？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是好朋友啊，她在維多利亞上學的時候，我們是同學。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"哪所學校？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，皇家近衛學校。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼說，你是士官？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......退役之前是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"一名維多利亞退役士官，身穿制服，夜闖另一個國家邊境城市的入城關口，並且還拿著制式武器——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是去除了彈射功能的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......但保留著填彈裝置，依然具有很強的爆破能力。沒錯吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）按照規定，我的確應該將破城矛上繳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼說，你不是正常退役？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"............"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼快就被問出來了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，早知道會有這一天，我上訊問學理論課的時候就該更努力一點的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你很想隱瞞自己的退役過程？小姐，如果你是逃兵，我這就該打電話叫人來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，請別叫人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我真的退役了，我向你保證！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會試著解釋一下，但是，有些資訊我實在沒法在這裡透露。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"先說說看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，事情是這樣的。三個月前，我還在軍隊裡，我們小隊當時在追查一個案件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"查案過程......呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只能說，因為查這個案件，我們小隊目前還活著......不，還能自由行動的，只剩下我一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，這回憶一定很慘烈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你的理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，我有一點不明白。你連命都差點沒了，那幫維多利亞軍隊的老頭子不該給你頒上一堆獎章嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"獎勵？算啦，案子沒查完，我從來沒想過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但至少......我以為他們能多派些人來幫我繼續追查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"結果沒有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很令人驚訝是不是？警官，我比你更想不明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一開始試著找了很多人。從半島郡駐軍開始，他們每一個都在安撫我，讓我等待上級的命令，允諾我會儘快增派人手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽從指示，結果發現時間越耗越久，調查卻全無進展。於是我決定繞開地方駐軍，直接聯絡倫蒂尼姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個過程不算太容易，好在我之前累積了一些怎麼跟駐軍打交道的經驗，並且一路上總能遇上好心人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後，我成功抵達了距離倫蒂尼姆最近的一處軍營——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是在那裡，我做出了退役的決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"因為他們還是沒有幫你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"長官，伯爵，大公爵......他們可能有別的苦衷吧。反正他們這麼跟我說，我全聽進去了，直到那一天......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我無意中聽見，中校在和另一個我不認識的軍官談論對我的安排。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我沒想到——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"距離事件發生過去整整三十七天，我沒等來增援，只等來了一紙調令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你心裡肯定很不好受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我的心情很複雜。難過？還是失望，或者憤怒......我說不上來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在得知這個消息的時候，我的腦子一片空白，唯一的念頭是慶幸自己把破城矛放在了訓練室，而不是帶在手邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"不然的話，你會動手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也不會吧......大概。畢竟，我始終記得自己的職責。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同樣的，作為一名維多利亞軍人，我必須服從命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......警官，在那一刻，我發現我做不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有一支軍隊能容忍抗拒命令的士兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。就這樣，我很快想通了，我要在他們決定我的去向之前，自己離開軍隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"他們答應放你走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"退役手續還算順利啦，以前隊長和陳陳都抱怨過我太倔，中校他們當然怎麼勸阻都沒用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，就在我去軍營交還武器的時候，我遇到了襲擊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......襲擊？犯人是誰？你在追查的人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很有可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是沒想過，他們為什麼會選擇在軍營動手，明明之前一個多月都沒有管我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"會不會是敵人最終還是滲透進了軍隊高層？又或者根本就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，這些都不重要了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我打退了其中幾個，可他們人還是很多，我不得不拿著破城矛匆匆逃了出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"之後呢？你就這樣逃出了維多利亞？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說逃......也沒錯，哈哈，這一路真是挺狼狽的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道那群人很難纏，自然不敢回家，我不想讓鬼魂也纏上媽媽他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"軍隊更是回不去了，找警察也只會給他們添麻煩，我想來想去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"只能找同學了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，是呀，陳陳答應過的，我有事沒事都能來找她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，警官，你笑什麼呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事。所以，你來了龍門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她確實是在龍門，我沒搞錯吧？去年年初的拜年電訊還是從這個地方發出來的呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"繼續說說你為何要硬闖關口吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"無論有沒有人在後頭追殺，你好歹也是維多利亞公民，不至於連張正常的車票都買不起吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......還真買不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？維多利亞職業軍人的收入還不及龍門街頭仔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有啦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個......我的錢包和護照都丟在萊塔尼亞了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......我是不是該佩服你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——被炸得一點不剩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我確實該佩服你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不光錢包，我也差一點點就被炸飛啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那時候我才剛離開維多利亞，蹭了一支商隊的車橫穿萊塔尼亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛入境沒兩天，車子路過一座小城市，當地一位子爵挺熱情地招待了我們，還安排我們住進了最好的酒店。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到了傍晚的時候，其他人去赴宴了，我一個人待在分給我的豪華套間裡，有服務員送了一份免費的晚餐過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我吃了幾口，總覺得萊塔尼亞菜太精緻了，我吃不太習慣，就想著出門找個農貿市場溜達幾圈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒想到才剛到樓下，轟隆一聲，我房間的窗框就砸到了我跟前，而且整個都變了形。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"這炸得還真狠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是呀，就算是我，被從十幾層高的房間裡炸飛出來，也可能會沒命吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......只是可能？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已經很嚴重了呀！真沒想到萊塔尼亞也這麼水深火熱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，看來你從精神到身體都比那倒楣的窗框結實多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？多謝......誇獎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，你知道是誰要炸你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道啊。我加入商隊沒幾天，有力出力，應該沒什麼仇家吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實......我也沒那麼在乎這一個問題的答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自從開始查這個案子，謎團越來越多，就沒有什麼豁然開朗的時候，我都習慣啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，你來龍門，是想讓你朋友撐你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，我不需要別人保護，只是想問問陳陳願不願意幫我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？你還想著回維多利亞查案？哪怕這麼多人要殺你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"還真一點猶豫都沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從維多利亞到龍門，我走了幾個月。但凡我有半點猶豫，這條路我都走不下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我答應過，我要把真相帶到所有人面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道真相在哪，我就去找——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敵人不讓我說話，我偏要說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"離開維多利亞，我沒有回頭。可要是哪天我做好了回去的準備，我更不會有一絲動搖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"不怕嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我信你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"把不怕死掛在嘴邊的戰士，要嘛是在說大話，要嘛是還沒想明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信你做好了該做的準備，也相信你沒有說假話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼說，你會幫我聯絡陳......陳警司？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"給，這袋子裡有幾個叉燒包。涼差不多了，將就一下還能吃。在荒地裡趕了這麼久路，你該餓壞了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是像你這麼強悍的瓦伊凡，該吃飯還得吃飯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真好吃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，不對啊，這也是訊問流程？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"流程？早結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為你會問我一些我和陳陳過去的事，來驗證我有沒有說謊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"沒必要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"該知道的，我早知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的意思是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，等等，我想起來了，我也知道你，你是近衛局的星......星......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"星......星？哈哈，最好還是別這麼叫我，尤其是別在她們面前這麼叫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣吧，風笛小姐，按照規矩，麻煩你再多在這屋待一會，我先出去一下，見個人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"審完了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"既然好奇，為什麼不進來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"......有什麼值得好奇的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島的人都在路上了，她在這裡根本待不長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"算算時間，他們是該來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，那條仆街龍，這陣子也不知道又在哪裡逍遙，害我們在這裡加班。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"要是老陳聽說老同學千里迢迢找來，一點都不著急是不可能的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"她雖然不說，但對朋友一向仗義，Missy，你又不是不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"......她的朋友，關我什麼事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"還有你，明明剛接到消息就第一時間給羅德島發了信，為什麼還要費這工夫審訊？唱黑臉很過癮？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼多小子看著呢，都是當差的人，流程還是要好好走完的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"再說了，你就不想打探打探，老陳之後可能會捲進什麼新的危險裡去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"......不想知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，煩死了！等裡面那傢伙被羅德島的人接走，你就給我好好彙報清楚......不許偷懶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"看，羅德島的幹員來領人了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸欸欸，什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陳陳竟然已經不在龍門近衛局了，你們讓我去一個別的地方等著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，那家公司叫什麼來著......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——羅、德、島？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["近衛局成員"]},{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["星熊"]},{"speakerId":"char_308_swire","aliases":["詩懷雅"]}]}
